  "intro": [
    "Start a fresh Release 29 game and use random seed 1. This deterministic seed keeps the Adventurer in the Map Room long enough to lead him to the Guarded Door.",
    "Read spells before copying them into the illuminated book. Keep the egg for the Adventurer, use the pencil and parchment to solve the map, and follow the rest stop before carrying the Turtle\u2019s brittle scroll back from the Engine Room.",
